   "note": "HR911105A - REJECTED, stated loudly because it is the default magjack in most hobby ESP32/W5500 designs and has the deepest stock and lowest price of any magjack here (48280 pcs, 1.5509 USD @10). Its datasheet schematic has NO power pins: chip-side P4/P5 are winding centre taps for bypassing only, P7 is NC, P8 is chassis GND, and the spare pairs J4/J5/J7/J8 terminate into the 4 x 75 ohm + 1000 pF/2 kV Bob Smith network. LCSC's own parametric agrees: PoE = 'Non-PoE'. Same rejection for HR911130A (C54408, 9942), HY951180A (C34677, 8823), HR911130C (C50933, 4226), HR961160C (C55683, 2672), HR871181A (C49312, 1804), HY911130A (C55679, 1539) and HY911102A (C21842, 489) - every one is 'Non-PoE'."
